   "widgets_values": [
    "# AIOFM Swap v2.1 \u2014 read this\n\n**Phase 1 IS the product.** First live run proved Qwen nails the\nswap on its own; the polish phases degraded it (painted hair =\n4x-UltraSharp on AI images, waxy face = PuLID re-rendering an\nalready-correct face). So Phases 2 and 3 now ship BYPASSED.\n\nDefault instruction = face-only swap (keeps her hair/body/pose/\nclothing from REF 1). For a full person swap, say \"Replace the\nwoman in image 1 with the woman in image 2...\" instead.\n\nEnable Phase 2 (Ctrl+B the FaceDetailer) ONLY if Phase 1's face\nisn't her enough \u2014 now gentler: PuLID 0.8, denoise 0.30.\nEnable Phase 3 only for print-size needs; prefer the SeedVR2\ngroup for upscaling photos \u2014 it doesn't paint.\n\nFreeform edits: append sentences to the instruction box."
   ]
  }
